@Main_HostAddress = http://localhost:5213

### Simulate a call from the caller-ID phone app
POST {{Main_HostAddress}}/api/incoming-call
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: REDACTED

{ "mobileNumber": "03123456" }

### Orders
GET {{Main_HostAddress}}/api/Orders
Accept: application/json

### Call history (bell)
GET {{Main_HostAddress}}/api/Orders/Calls?take=20
Accept: application/json
